  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p>추억의 광고</p><p><iframe id=\"v4cfd338h8nGnWshHc3qdTn\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v4cfd338h8nGnWshHc3qdTn?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY0Y2ZkMzM4aDhuR25Xc2hIYzNxZFRuIiwidGlkIjoiOThhNjBlNDAtNWI1My00YWU0LTlmYTYtOTUwMjZiN2QzNmRkIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg2Njk1fQ.b1zQV-ZUqYuAR4wRXxTQ_dMJ4M571jNjMw0U8DUSv7j_UHrOGgycDwB-iVhrf3MVs7Pbz_xZyZgPx9AbXds9hw&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><iframe id=\"vf8de2GHaOy2wz8oap4wUU8\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vf8de2GHaOy2wz8oap4wUU8?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZmOGRlMkdIYU95Mnd6OG9hcDR3VVU4IiwidGlkIjoiZDI1MzQ0NjEtMzJlZC00YjdkLWI1ZDUtZmVlN2UxYmJiZjNhIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg2Njk1fQ.Db-MFLGA4ZlnCgBpCmmYaSinqUrSkbi85wC8JWDshZgbtX8Dk1aZICGAOj_3TqyuF8vvmWtCjjv1AVyzWVBTMg&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
